<title>USA: Newark, N.J., won by Ryan, Beck.</title>
<headline>Newark, N.J., won by Ryan, Beck.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said it won $15.100 million of N ewark, N.J., general obligation tax appeal refunding bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.59 percent.</p>
